+| 5 | **Callable parameter modes** (H7/H8, `[FN-6]` amended, `[FN-6a]`): borrowed/default, `mut` and `owned` in `fn_type`; mutable helper inputs are `mut` reborrows; `Callable[Args, R]` preserves the mode vector as compiler-known metadata. `[LT-11a]` rejects a `with_views*_mut` callback whose callable type omits the required `mut` mode, naming the mode mismatch rather than reading `MutSpan[T]` as an implicit ownership mode. No helper consumes its input view, and modes are compile-time only. | III, V |
