+## Implementation Completeness Matrix
+
+The repository MUST maintain a machine-readable implementation matrix with one row per normative rule.
+
+Minimum schema:
+
+```text
+rule_id
+spec_location
+feature
+parser_status
+resolver_status
+typechecker_status
+borrowck_status
+dropck_status
+mir_status
