+## 0.9.6_Hardened_2 Arena-Backed Container Completion Record
+
+**Version treatment:** owner-approved hardening completion of an existing named standard-library
+surface. **Amendment class:** OWNER-APPROVED SEMANTIC COMPLETION. H1 remains the immutable
+predecessor. This cut does not change any existing ownership, borrowing, Arena allocation,
+initialization, failure, effect, FFI, ABI, reload, or determinism rule outside the completed
+`[ARN-5]` family.
+
+**Resolved contract.** `std.collections` publicly owns `ArenaArray`, `ArenaMap`,
+`CapacityError`, `ArenaArrayIter`, `ArenaArrayIterMut`, and `ArenaMapIter`; none is a prelude
+name. Both containers are empty after `with_capacity`, allocate backing storage once from the
