+associated-type `Iterator[Item = ...]` interface; no opaque-return or second iterator mechanism is
+introduced.
+
+**Evidence boundary.** This specification completion does not claim that the compiler, runtime, or
+standard library implements `ARN-COLL-1`. Executable status remains external repository evidence.
